{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2024-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1704067200, "end_date": 1704671999, "month_true_total": 1020, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:54:32 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "155518676", "author": {"steamid": "76561198447892362", "personaname": "spiderbot1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198447892362/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1211, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 489, "last_played": 1706916171, "avatar": "5b37e7881023034eda51b2f2ae98bc0b98f7d0be"}, "language": "english", "review": "Grabbed a friend willing to tank for me and got to run about with a dog for hours with the hardest boss being some cubes\nHighly recommend this experience", "timestamp_created": 1704671654, "timestamp_updated": 1704671654, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155516951", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128111755", "personaname": "Night Shade", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198128111755/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2448, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1844, "last_played": 1710702730, "avatar": "049116dc3827584518d1124b90aa06b7fab8d023"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing multiplayer game", "timestamp_created": 1704669687, "timestamp_updated": 1704669687, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155515536", "author": {"steamid": "76561197998332251", "personaname": "Crow", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CrowM/", "num_games_owned": 236, "num_reviews": 177, "playtime_forever": 2769, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2760, "last_played": 1704668682, "avatar": "82b7a19b25a8610a157841ac4a7d6cbb2671c4af"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant 2 is tons of fun, played through the game in Co-Op. \nLots of variety to play and spec for what you like.\n\nLots of different types of guns for close, mid & long range.\nCombined with different skills & traits every character and play through can be completely different.\n\nPlayed on Nightmare difficulty and some of the bosses were difficult but it was just a case of being able to recognise patterns as usual with any \"Souls-like\" game.\n\nRemnant 2 still has the rng maps which is slightly annoying but I would still recommend when on sale as it was lots of fun.", "timestamp_created": 1704668116, "timestamp_updated": 1704668116, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155515475", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987505337", "personaname": "BogMan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ordvirr/", "num_games_owned": 983, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 1844, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1844, "last_played": 1704667884, "avatar": "be7f5b7b9408df27f699086dcb6443650ab06df5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Phenomenal game. Great game play loop. Plenty of ability to customize your build. Solid art direction. Neat lore. Great Soulslike bossfights. Had to look up a puzzle or two as they aren't my forte. As far as replay-ability goes this game is more like an ARPG (Diablo, Path of Exile) than an RPG. Reroll some maps for different gear etc. Better than the first in every way and the first was GREAT.", "timestamp_created": 1704668065, "timestamp_updated": 1704668065, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155513808", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114147244", "personaname": "PbZeppelin42", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PbZeppelin42/", "num_games_owned": 828, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1407, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32, "last_played": 1728085391, "avatar": "933860e5e7817b0fcb301f52c49fe266328fec3d"}, "language": "english", "review": "A modern game that does not blow out your eardrums when you first open it 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1704666295, "timestamp_updated": 1704666295, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155512621", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024952187", "personaname": "crownedsun", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024952187/", "num_games_owned": 753, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 5883, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2017, "last_played": 1742854723, "avatar": "f96a2b505ffc28e98421348263cebc9c2165613d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great single-player game, even better co-op experience. In fact, hell, I recommend having a friend to play the game with as it makes the experience quite a bit more enjoyable.", "timestamp_created": 1704665099, "timestamp_updated": 1704665099, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155511352", "author": {"steamid": "76561198330465188", "personaname": "9SPINEZZ", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198330465188/", "num_games_owned": 66, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 5332, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1866, "last_played": 1730045622, "avatar": "a7edca62287a198da4f0485033bb87a3cf8dd08f"}, "language": "english", "review": "GREAT GAME", "timestamp_created": 1704663858, "timestamp_updated": 1704663858, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155511319", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011303808", "personaname": "Yorito Nagai", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/YoritoNagai/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 1442, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1442, "last_played": 1701303217, "avatar": "4b1c3856728ad18e7ec018cd80b8f93446eece6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's just kinda boring. Constantly starved for upgrade resources, majority of the archetypes are hidden and require constantly resetting at a bonfire to get in order to waste players time. No reason for a co-op game to be this grindy, it isn't an MMO. Gameplay is smooth but uninspired, bunch of weapons but you are discouraged from experimenting due to resources being so limited and only getting part of them back when you reset a weapon to level 1 instead of everything.\n\nStory is eye-rolling, very uninspired. Most of the bosses are out of melee range so I don't know why they gave you a fleshed out melee upgrading and ability system when it's rarely useful when it matters most. RNG .0005% increase to primary weapon damage after firing for x seconds on a Tuesday type gear upgrades, looter shooter garbage.\n\nJust isn't worth a buy, I'd say $15 is the most I'd recommend paying for this. Nothing in this game \"needs\" to be experienced for someone who enjoys videogames.", "timestamp_created": 1704663823, "timestamp_updated": 1704663823, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.536349892616271973", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155511309", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128589411", "personaname": "dendaersnubben", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198128589411/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 9251, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6757, "last_played": 1733174145, "avatar": "cb25153eebdd22077dcfb322b625b2ab477f2b0b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent game, far better than Remnant 1", "timestamp_created": 1704663812, "timestamp_updated": 1704663812, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}